{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cold-sleep management puzzle action game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the artificial intelligence called Freezia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring peace and order to humankind by putting them into cold sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your job as Freezia to stabilize the temperature of the cold sleep pods within the time limit. Adjust the temperature in a timely manner and finish your duties promptly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be attentive when maintaining the temperature. If freezing accidents occur frequently, it may put you in danger as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanying you are an oracle proselytizing artificial intelligence and a cheerful crew to put into hibernation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an ice-cold star shining down on a closed-off world, observe as the curtain falls on the future of humankind.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Night, and Sweet Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3355790/c5d0d8441f2e20fe5e7dc6e76234b64d86eb6911.jpg"},{"name":" Ice-Cold Star of Eternity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3355790/72898b42e7e6839e101e8c7a389cab5a4b675ad9.jpg"},{"name":"Light Speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3355790/9ea3cf8d646b408729b594f675c8d1337a0f5625.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355790?t=1754618527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754618527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355790/ded17e3080f09407b424fd4cf8afe0d572